# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
#
# The intake form and the files it is built from are always re-checked with the server before use. Without this, a phone or an
# in-app browser (WhatsApp, Instagram) can keep an old copy of the form and send answers the server no longer accepts — that is
# how a form can fail for one person and work for everyone else. Re-checking is cheap: an unchanged file answers "not modified".
/intake
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/intake.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/intake-rules.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/care-copy.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
